{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f7cc5169ba48dd31c49745.poster.avif?t=1770010153\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f7cc5169ba48dd31c49745.webm?t=1770010153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f7cc5169ba48dd31c49745.mp4?t=1770010153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rediscover the lost art of cooking in a post-apocalyptic world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a time when cooking has been forgotten, take on the role of a lone chef on a quest for the ultimate dish. Travel across mysterious lands, meet delightful companions, and craft a story all your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/f84e0a42353893cee8cc7312078e2995.poster.avif?t=1770010153\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/f84e0a42353893cee8cc7312078e2995.webm?t=1770010153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/f84e0a42353893cee8cc7312078e2995.mp4?t=1770010153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield kitchen tools as weapons in side-scrolling action battles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against dynamic enemies and bosses that change with the day-night cycle. Cook meals to grow stronger, or learn powerful new skills from fellow adventurers you encounter. Make the most of every resource to defeat foes and uncover rare, high-value ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/6313e458a2eb61159780b5b95de65579.poster.avif?t=1770010153\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/6313e458a2eb61159780b5b95de65579.webm?t=1770010153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/6313e458a2eb61159780b5b95de65579.mp4?t=1770010153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fiery feast awaits at every campsite.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the unforgiving wilderness, nothing is more important than a hearty meal. Use your hunted ingredients to whip up gourmet meals\u2014or surprising creations you never expected. Explore every hidden corner and uncover rare recipes hidden off the beaten path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/97722106fa5e917f39b9b8fd64de5845.poster.avif?t=1770010153\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/97722106fa5e917f39b9b8fd64de5845.webm?t=1770010153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/97722106fa5e917f39b9b8fd64de5845.mp4?t=1770010153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your choices shape the story.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with charming characters over shared meals and heartfelt conversations. Your decisions impact relationships\u2014some will blossom, others may fall apart. Every choice opens new narrative paths, making each playthrough a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3280150?t=1770010153","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/f72e47ff0fe85cd7c16ae031e3d2659c4141e6c5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770010153","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/dbca90516ef76df3a04f0aeb5b219eb57341a3a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770010153","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/dbca90516ef76df3a04f0aeb5b219eb57341a3a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770010153","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3280190,"description":""},{"appid":3280190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f7cc5169ba48dd31c49745.poster.avif?t=1770010153\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f7cc5169ba48dd31c49745.webm?t=1770010153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f